tool_settings.extrude.amount=Amount
extrude.amount.tooltip=Extrusion distance in displayed scene units. Negative values extrude inward. Drag the yellow handle or edit Amount to adjust the latest extrusion. Use Extrude again to start the next extrusion. Drag freely, hold Ctrl to snap to the grid, or hold Shift for precision. Vertex snapping uses the Hold Vertex Snap binding (V by default). Along Normals and Individual increase when dragging upward.
